  "es": "En Asturias se emiten 15,9 toneladas por habitante, casi cinco veces más que en Madrid (3,2): más de dos tercios de lo que emite Asturias sale de sus centrales eléctricas y su industria",
  "en": "In Asturias 15.9 tonnes are emitted per inhabitant, almost five times as much as in Madrid (3.2): more than two thirds of Asturias's emissions come from its power stations and its industry"
